, Ben! Is this your book?","It is a big blue book.","That black pen is my pen.","And these keys? Are they your keys?"]},"question":"¿Cómo es el libro que encontró Mia?","options":["Grande y azul","Chico y azul","Grande y negro"]},"answer":"Grande y azul","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"«It is a big blue book».","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u05-context-e02","lesson_id":"a1-u05-context","position":2,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee el texto y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.a1-u05-found-objects","document":"message","setting":"Mia encontró cosas en el aula y le escribe a Ben.","from":"Mia","to":"Ben","lines":["Hi, Ben! Is this your book?","It is a big blue book.","That black pen is my pen.","And these keys? Are they your keys?"]},"question":"¿De quién es el bolígrafo negro?","options":["De Mia","De Ben","De la profesora"]},"answer":"De Mia","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mia escribe «That black pen is my pen».","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u05-context-e03","lesson_id":"a1-u05-context","position":3,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee el texto y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.a1-u05-found-objects","document":"message","setting":"Mia encontró cosas en el aula y le escribe a Ben.","from":"Mia","to":"Ben","lines":["Hi, Ben! Is this your book?","It is a big blue book.","That black pen is my pen.","And these keys? Are they your keys?"]},"question":"¿Qué quiere saber Mia sobre las llaves?","options":["Dónde están","Si son de Ben","De qué color son"]},"answer":"Si son de Ben","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Pregunta «Are they your keys?»: si son de Ben.","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u05-context-e04","lesson_id":"a1-u05-context","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es