":"Ms. Park","text":"Good morning! What is your name?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Do you speak Spanish?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Please repeat the word slowly."}]},"question":"¿Qué respuesta corresponde a su segunda pregunta?","options":["Yes, I do.","Yes, I am.","Yes, it is."]},"answer":"Yes, I do.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A «Do you speak Spanish?» se responde con «do»: «Yes, I do» o «No, I don't».","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u12-context-e03","lesson_id":"a1-u12-context","position":3,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.a1-u12-teacher-to-you","setting":"En clase, la profesora te habla a ti.","speakers":[{"name":"Ms. Park","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.85,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Good morning! What is your name?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Do you speak Spanish?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Please repeat the word slowly."}]},"question":"¿Qué te pide que hagas al final?","options":["Que escribas la palabra","Que traduzcas la palabra al español","Que repitas la palabra despacio"]},"answer":"Que repitas la palabra despacio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"«Please repeat the word slowly».","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u12-context-e04","lesson_id":"a1-u12-context","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.a1-u12-in-class","setting":"Ben y su profesora conversan en clase.","speakers":[{"name":"Ben","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Park","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.85,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ben","text":"Sorry, I don't understand. Can you speak slowly, please?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Of course. How many books do you have?"},{"speaker":"Ben","text":"Three books."},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Good. Which book is your favorite?"},{"speaker":"Ben","text":"The English book, because it is fun."}]},"question":"¿Qué le pide Ben a la profesora?","options":["Que hable más despacio","Que repita la respuesta","Que le preste un libro"]},"answer":"Que hable más despacio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"«Can you speak slowly, please?».","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u12-context-e05","lesson_id":"a1-u12-context","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.a1-u12-in-class","setting":"Ben y su profesora conversan en clase.","speakers":[{"name":"Ben","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Park","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.85,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ben","text":"Sorry, I don't understand. Can you speak slowly, please?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Of course. How many books do you have?"},{"speaker":"Ben","text":"Three books."},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Good. Which book is your favorite?"},{"speaker":"Ben","text":"The English book, because it is fun."}]},"question":"¿Cuántos libros tiene Ben?","options":["Dos","Uno","Tres"]},"answer":"Tres","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"A «How many books do you have?» responde «Three books».","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u12-context-e06","lesson_id":"a1-u12-context","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.a1-u12-in-class","setting":"Ben y su profesora conversan en clase.","speakers":[{"name":"Ben","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ms. Park","voice":"b"}],"rate":0.85,"lines":[{"speaker":"Ben","text":"Sorry, I don't understand. Can you speak slowly, please?"},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Of course. How many books do you have?"},{"speaker":"Ben","text":"Three books."},{"speaker":"Ms. Park","text":"Good. Which book is your favorite?"},{"speaker":"Ben","text":"The English book, because it is fun."}]},"question":"¿Por qué el libro de inglés es su favorito?","options":["Porque es grande","Porque es divertido","Porque es nuevo"]},"answer":"Porque es divertido","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"«The English book, because it is fun».","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u13-context-e01","lesson_id":"a1-u13-context","position":1,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee el texto y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.a1-u13-hotel-form","document":"form","setting":"La ficha que completa una huésped al llegar a un hotel.","title":"Hotel registration","lines":["First name: Sofia","Surname: Ruiz","Nationality: Mexican","City: Puebla","Country: Mexico","Phone: 555-0142","Email: sofia.ruiz@example.com","Room: 12","Nights: 3"]},"question":"¿Cuál es el apellido de la huésped?","options":["Sofia","Puebla","Ruiz"]},"answer":"Ruiz","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"«Surname» es el apellido: Ruiz. «First name» es el nombre de pila (Sofia) y «City», la ciudad (Puebla).","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u13-context-e02","lesson_id":"a1-u13-context","position":2,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee el texto y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.a1-u13-hotel-form","document":"form","setting":"La ficha que completa una huésped al llegar a un hotel.","title":"Hotel registration","lines":["First name: Sofia","Surname: Ruiz","Nationality: Mexican","City: Puebla","Country: Mexico","Phone: 555-0142","Email: sofia.ruiz@example.com","Room: 12","Nights: 3"]},"question":"¿Qué indica el 12 de la ficha?","options":["Cuántas noches se queda","El número de su habitación","Su número de teléfono"]},"answer":"El número de su habitación","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dice «Room: 12»: es la habitación. Las noches son 3 («Nights: 3»).","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u13-context-e03","lesson_id":"a1-u13-context","position":3,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee el texto y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.a1-u13-hotel-form","document":"form","setting":"La ficha que completa una huésped al llegar a un hotel.","title":"Hotel registration","lines":["First name: Sofia","Surname: Ruiz","Nationality: Mexican","City: Puebla","Country: Mexico","Phone: 555-0142","Email: sofia.ruiz@example.com","Room: 12","Nights: 3"]},"question":"¿De dónde viene Sofia?","options":["De la habitación 12 del hotel","De una ciudad de España","De Puebla, en México"]},"answer":"De Puebla, en México","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"«City: Puebla» y «Country: Mexico» son su ciudad y su país. En el hotel sólo se queda tres noches.","difficulty":2,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"a1-u13-context-e04","lesson_id":"a1-u13-context","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde.","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.a1-u13-reception","setting":"Eres Sofia Ruiz, la huésped de la ficha. Llegas al hotel y el recepcionista te habla a ti.","speakers":[{"name":"Mark","voice":"a"}],"rate":0.85,"lines":[{"speaker":"Mark","text":"Good evening, and welcome! My name is Mark."},{"speaker":"Mark","text":"What is your surname, please?"},{"speaker":"Mark","text":"Thank you. How do you spell it?"},{"speaker":"Mark","text":"And where are you from?"},{"speaker":"Mark","text":"OK. Please write your phone number here."},{"speaker":"Mark","text":"Your room is number twelve. Here is your key."}]},"question":"¿Qué te pregunta primero Mark?","options":["Tu nombre de pila","Tu número de habitación","Tu apellido"]},"answer":"Tu apellido","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"«What is your surname, please?»: «surname» es el apellido. Mark sólo dice su propio nombre.