":"Traduce al inglés","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"siempre y cuando / con la condición de que"},"answer":"provided that","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-provided-that"]},{"id":"b2-u02-rev2-e10","lesson_id":"b2-u02-rev2","position":10,"type":"complete_word","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Escribe la palabra completa","payload":{"type":"complete_word","masked":"a_ l_n_ a_","hint":"siempre que / mientras"},"answer":"as long as","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":20,"words":["en-as-long-as"]},{"id":"b2-u02-l05-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u02-l05","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"He turned ___ the job because the salary was too low.","translation":"Rechazó el trabajo porque el sueldo era muy bajo.","options":["down","on","off","up"]},"answer":"down","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Turn down (rechazar); turn on / off es prender / apagar.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-turn-down"]},{"id":"b2-u02-l05-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u02-l05","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I'm ___ I'll have to turn it down.","translation":"Me temo que voy a tener que rechazarlo.","options":["afraid","sorry","scared","worried"]},"answer":"afraid","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"I’m afraid… suaviza una mala noticia (me temo que).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-turn-down"]},{"id":"b2-u02-l05-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u02-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u2-team","setting":"Una líder de equipo habla con un empleado que está desbordado.","speakers":[{"name":"Grace","voice":"a"},{"name":"Omar","voice":"