now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten.","The majority of people who live alone are over sixty, but the number of young people living alone is also rising.","It is often said that living alone makes people lonely. However, the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy with their lives.","What has declined is the number of large families. In 1970 the average family had four children. Today it has fewer than two."]},"question":"¿Cómo cambió el número de hogares de una sola persona?","options":["Pasó de uno de cada diez a uno de cada cuatro","Pasó de uno de cada cuatro a uno de cada diez","No cambió","Bajó a la mitad"]},"answer":"Pasó de uno de cada diez a uno de cada cuatro","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «one in four homes now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u03-l02-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l02","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-alone","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo sobre una encuesta acerca de las personas que viven solas.","title":"A table for one","lines":["Living alone used to be unusual. Today it is one of the biggest trends in our society.","According to a recent survey, one in four homes now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten.","The majority of people who live alone are over sixty, but the number of young people living alone is also rising.","It is often said that living alone makes people lonely. However, the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy with their lives.","What has declined is the number of large families. In 1970 the average family had four children. Today it has fewer than two."]},"question":"¿Qué dice la encuesta sobre la idea de que vivir solo hace sentir solo?","options":["Que la mayoría de quienes viven solos dicen ser felices","Que es cierta","Que sólo vale para los jóvenes","Que no lo preguntó"]},"answer":"Que la mayoría de quienes viven solos dicen ser felices","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u03-l02-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-alone","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo sobre una encuesta acerca de las personas que viven solas.","title":"A table for one","lines":["Living alone used to be unusual. Today it is one of the biggest trends in our society.","According to a recent survey, one in four homes now has only one person in it. Fifty years ago, the figure was one in ten.","The majority of people who live alone are over sixty, but the number of young people living alone is also rising.","It is often said that living alone makes people lonely. However, the survey suggests the opposite: most people who live alone said they were happy with their lives.","What has declined is the number of large families. In 1970 the average family had four children. Today it has fewer than two."]},"question":"¿Qué disminuyó, según el artículo?","options":["El número de familias numerosas","El número de personas mayores","El número de hogares","El número de jóvenes"]},"answer":"El número de familias numerosas","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «What has declined is the number of large families».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u03-l02-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The pop