a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"¿Cómo muestran hoy los jóvenes que les importa su familia, según la socióloga?","options":["De otra forma, por ejemplo con una videollamada en vez de un almuerzo","Ya no lo muestran","Viviendo con sus padres","Yendo a la iglesia"]},"answer":"De otra forma, por ejemplo con una videollamada en vez de un almuerzo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dice: «They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u03-l05-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u03-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-market","document":"notice","setting":"Un aviso de la municipalidad sobre el mercado viejo.","title":"Our market is changing","lines":["The old market is being renovated and will be closed until the end of May.","The roof has already been repaired, and new lights are being installed this month.","The market has been used by local families for more than a hundred years. It is believed to be the oldest building in the neighborhood.","When the work is finished, the market will be used for concerts and festivals. The first festival is expected to take place in June.","Questions can be sent to the community office."]},"question":"¿Para qué se va a usar el mercado cuando terminen las obras?","options":["Para conciertos y festivales","Para viviendas","Para oficinas","Como escuela"]},"answer":"Para conciertos y festivales","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El aviso dice: «the market will be used for concerts and festivals».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2