io a una científica que inventó un filtro de agua.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mei","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"My guest today is Dr. Mei Lin, whose team has come up with a new way to clean water. Welcome."},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Thank you. Our filter, which costs less than five dollars, uses only sunlight to clean dirty water."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"That sounds like a real breakthrough. How did you get the idea?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed, which was very frustrating at the time. But the results showed something we didn't expect."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is there evidence that it works outside the lab?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Yes. We have tested it in forty villages, most of which have no clean water. The data are very clear."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What is the next step?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"We want to make it in large numbers. The invention is useless if the people who need it can't get it."}]},"question":"¿Cómo surgió la idea del filtro?","options":["Por casualidad, a partir de un experimento que falló","Después de años de planificación","Gracias a otro científico","En un viaje a un pueblo"]},"answer":"Por casualidad, a partir de un experimento que falló","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mei dice: «By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed… But the results showed something we didn’t expect».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u04-l01-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u04-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u4-interview","setting":"Una entrevista de radio a una científica que inventó un filtro de agua.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mei","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"My guest today is Dr. Mei Lin, whose team has come up with a new way to clean water. Welcome."},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Thank you. Our filter, which costs less than five dollars, uses only sunlight to clean dirty water."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"That sounds like a real breakthrough. How did you get the idea?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"By accident, actually. One of our experiments failed, which was very frustrating at the time. But the results showed something we didn't expect."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is there evidence that it works outside the lab?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"Yes. We have tested it in forty villages, most of which have no clean water. The data are very clear."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What is the next step?"},{"speaker":"Mei","text":"We want to make it in large numbers. The invention is useless if the people who need it can't get it."}]},"question":"¿Qué pruebas tienen de que el filtro funciona fuera del laboratorio?","options":["Lo probaron en cuarenta pueblos y los datos son claros","Ninguna todavía","Lo probaron en su ciudad","Lo usan en hospitales"]},"answer":"Lo probaron en cuarenta pueblos y los datos son claros","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mei dice: «We have tested it in forty villages… The data are very clear».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u04-l01-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u04-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","options":["The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","The experiment worked, and we learned a lot.","The experiment failed, but we learned nothing.","The experiments failed, but we learned a lot."]},"answer":"The experiment failed, but we learned a lot.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-experiment"]},{"id":"b2-u04-l01-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u04-l01","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_buildi