osition":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responde en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Are you still angry with your sister? (no, ya se reconciliaron)","translation":"¿Sigues enojado con tu hermana?"},"answer":"No, we have made up.","accepted_answers":["No, we've made up.","No, we made up.","No. We have made up."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-make-up"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l03-e10","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l03","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduce al inglés","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"No te lo tomes como algo personal."},"answer":"Don't take it personally.","accepted_answers":["Do not take it personally.","Please don't take it personally."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-take-it-personally"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e01","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":1,"type":"match_pairs","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Une cada palabra con su significado","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"mood","right":"humor / estado de ánimo"},{"left":"cheer up","right":"animar / levantar el ánimo"},{"left":"let down","right":"decepcionar / fallarle a alguien"},{"left":"grateful","right":"agradecido"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-mood","en-cheer-up","en-let-down","en-grateful"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"Don't talk to him now. He is in a bad ___.","translation":"No le hables ahora. Está de mal humor.","options":["mood","tone","day","time"]},"answer":"mood","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Be in a good / bad mood: estar de buen / mal humor.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-mood"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":4,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"I trusted you, and you let me ___.","translation":"Confié en ti y me fallaste.","options":["down","up","out","off"]},"answer":"down","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-let-down"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u6-sorry","document":"message","setting":"Un mensaje de disculpas entre amigos.","from":"Sara","to":"Max","lines":["Hi Max, I'm sorry I didn't reply. I wasn't angry with you. My first week at the new job was awful, and I was in a terrible mood.","Your joke was a bit much, but I know you didn’t mean it. I was being too sensitive.","I'm really grateful that you called last night. You always know how to cheer me up.","I promise I won't disappear like that again. I hate letting my friends down. Coffee on Saturday? Sara"]},"question":"¿Por qué Sara no contestaba los mensajes?","options":["Tuvo una primera semana horrible en el trabajo y estaba de muy mal humor","Estaba enojada con Max","Había perdido el teléfono","Estaba de viaje"]},"answer":"Tuvo una primera semana horrible en el trabajo y estaba de muy mal humor","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Sara escribe: «I wasn’t angry with you. My first week at the new job was awful, and I was in a terrible mood».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u6-sorry","document":"message","setting":"Un mensaje de disculpas entre amigos.","from":"Sara","to":"Max","lines":["Hi Max, I'm sorry I didn't reply. I wasn't angry with you. My first week at the new job was awful, and I was in a terrible mood.","Your joke was a bit much, but I know you didn’t mean it. I was being too sensitive.","I'm really grateful that you called last night. You always know how to cheer me up.","I promise I won't disappear like that again. I hate letting my friends down. Coffee on Saturday? Sara"]},"question":"¿Por qué Sara está agradecida con Max?","options":["Porque la llamó y siempre sabe cómo animarla","Porque le pidió perdón por escrito","Porque la ayudó con el trabajo","Porque le regaló un café"]},"answer":"Porque la llamó y siempre sabe cómo animarla","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Sara escribe: «I’m really grateful that you called last night. You always know how to cheer me up».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u6-sorry","document":"message","setting":"Un mensaje de disculpas entre amigos.","from":"Sara","to":"Max","lines":["Hi Max, I'm sorry I didn't reply. I wasn't angry with you. My first week at the new job was awful, and I was in a terrible mood.","Your joke was a bit much, but I know you didn’t mean it. I was being too sensitive.","I'm really grateful that you called last night. You always know how to cheer me up.","I promise I won't disappear like that again. I hate letting my friends down. Coffee on Saturday? Sara"]},"question":"¿Qué reconoce Sara sobre el chiste?","options":["Que fue un poco fuerte, pero ella se lo tomó demasiado a pecho","Que fue muy gracioso","Que no lo leyó","Que Max lo dijo para molestarla"]},"answer":"Que fue un poco fuerte, pero ella se lo tomó demasiado a pecho","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Sara escribe: «Your joke was a bit much, but I know you didn’t mean it. I was being too sensitive».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":8,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"Cheer up! Tomorrow will be better.","options":["Cheer up! Tomorrow will be better.","Cheer up! Tomorrow will be worse.","Cheer up! Today will be better.","Hurry up! Tomorrow will be better."]},"answer":"Cheer up! Tomorrow will be better.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-cheer-up"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e09","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responde en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why is she not speaking to him? (porque él le falló)","translation":"¿Por qué ella no le habla?"},"answer":"Because he let her down.","accepted_answers":["He let her down.","Because he has let her down.","Because he let her down again."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-let-down"]},{"id":"b2-u06-l04-e10","lesson_id":"b2-u06-l04","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduce al inglés","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Te estoy muy agradecido por tu ayuda."},"answer":"I am very grateful for your help.","accepted_answers":["I'm very grateful for your help.","I am really grateful for your help.","I'm really grateful for your help."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-grateful"]},{"id":"b2-u06-rev2-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u06-rev2","position":2,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"cheer up","options":["cheer up","fall out","stubborn","guilty"]},"answer":"cheer up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-cheer-up"]},{"id":"b2-u06-rev2-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u06-rev2","position