l yesterday. My aunt has already shared it with the whole family."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"Is it true, though? The post claims that doctors recommend it."},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Which doctors? It doesn’t say. That’s how misinformation spreads: no names, no sources, just a big promise."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"So it’s just a rumor?"},{"speaker":"Amy","text":"Probably. A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all."},{"speaker":"Zoe","text":"I'll send the link to your aunt, then. Before she shares the next one!"}]},"question":"¿Qué encontró el sitio de verificación?","options":["Ninguna prueba de que sea cierto","Que es cierto","Que lo dijo un médico famoso","Que la publicación se borró"]},"answer":"Ninguna prueba de que sea cierto","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Amy dice: «A fact-checking website looked at it this morning. They found no evidence at all».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u08-l01-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l01","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"It's just a rumor. Don't believe it.","options":["It's just a rumor. Don't believe it.","It's just a rumor. Believe it.","It's not a rumor. Don't believe it.","It's just a story. Don't believe it."]},"answer":"It's just a rumor. Don't believe it.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-rumor"]},{"id":"b2-u08-l01-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l01","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordena las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["There","is","a","lot","of","misinformation","online"],"translation":"Hay mucha desinformación en internet."},"answer":"There is a lot of misinformation online.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-misinformation"]},{"id":"b2-u08-l01-e0