uir oficinas","Que el parque iba a ser más grande","Que la alcaldesa iba a renunciar","Que las oficinas se iban a cerrar"]},"answer":"Que ya estaba decidido cerrar el parque para construir oficinas","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La noticia dice: «A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u08-l02-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l02","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Una noticia de un diario local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"¿Qué advirtió y qué sugirió la alcaldesa?","options":["Que no crean todo lo que leen en internet y que consulten la página de la ciudad","Que no vayan al parque","Que borren la publicación","Que llamen a la municipalidad"]},"answer":"Que no crean todo lo que leen en internet y que consulten la página de la ciudad","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La noticia dice: «She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u08-l02-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l02","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening"