local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"¿Qué admitió la alcaldesa?","options":["Que la ciudad había hablado de oficinas nuevas en la zona","Que iban a cerrar el parque","Que la publicación era cierta","Que no conocía el plan"]},"answer":"Que la ciudad había hablado de oficinas nuevas en la zona","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La noticia dice: «She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u08-l05-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u8-mayor","document":"post","setting":"Una noticia de un diario local.","title":"City news","from":"The Daily Courier","lines":["Mayor denies plan to close Central Park","The mayor has denied claims that Central Park will be closed to build offices. A post on social media had suggested that the decision was already made, and it was shared more than fifty thousand times.","\"This is completely false,\" the mayor said yesterday. She admitted that the city had discussed new offices in the area, but she insisted that the park was never part of the plan.","She also warned people not to believe everything they read online, and suggested checking the city website for official information.","The person who created the post has refused to comment."]},"question":"¿Qué hizo la persona que creó la publicación?","options":["Se negó a hacer comentarios","Pidió perdón","Borró la publicación","Habló con la alcaldesa"]},"answer":"Se negó a hacer comentarios","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La noticia termina: «The person who created the post has refused to comment».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u08-l05-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u8-interview","setting":"Una entrevista en la televisión a un político.","speakers":[{"name":"Journalist","voice":"a"},{"name":"Hart","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Mr. Hart, a newspaper has accused your party of using public money for its campaign. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I completely deny that. Every dollar we spent was ours."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"But you admitted last week that the campaign had used government offices."},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I admitted using one office for one meeting. That's very different."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Will you publish the campaign accounts?"},{"speaker":"Hart","text":"I refuse to answer questions based on rumors. I insist that we haven't done anything wrong."},{"speaker":"Journalist","text":"Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe."}]},"question":"¿Qué sugiere la periodista con su último comentario?","options":["Que mucha gente no le va a creer a Hart","Que Hart tiene razón","Que la entrevista terminó bien","Que el público no la estaba mirando"]},"answer":"Que mucha gente no le va a creer a Hart","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La periodista dice: «Many viewers will find that answer hard to believe».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u08-l05-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The program has a large audience.","options":["The program has a large audience.","The program has a small audience.","The program had a large audience.","The concert has a large audience."]},"answer":"The program has a large audience.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-audience"]},{"id":"b2-u08-l05-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l05","position":8,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordena las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["She","suggested","checking","the","official","website"],"translation":"Sugirió consultar la página oficial."},"answer":"She suggested checking the official website.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-suggest"]},{"id":"b2-u08-l05-e09","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l05","position":9,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responde en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"What did the post claim? (que el parque se iba a cerrar)","translation":"¿Qué afirmaba la publicación?"},"answer":"It claimed that the park was going to close.","accepted_answers":["It claimed that the park would close.","It claimed that the park would be closed.","It claimed the park was going to close."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-claim"]},{"id":"b2-u08-l05-e10","lesson_id":"b2-u08-l05","position":10,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduce al inglés","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"Reconoció haberse equivocado."},"answer":"She admitted making a mistake.","accepted_answers":["He admitted making a mistake.","She admitted that she had made a mistake.","He a