ssed","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Would have + participio (passed).","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-would-have"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l01","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I ___ listened to my teacher, I would have studied science.","translation":"Si le hubiera hecho caso a mi profesora, habría estudiado ciencias.","options":["had","have","would","did"]},"answer":"had","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Después de if va el past perfect (had + participio), no would.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-would-have"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l01","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"If I hadn't left, I ___ have started my business.","translation":"Si no me hubiera ido, no habría empezado mi negocio.","options":["wouldn't","won't","didn't","hadn't"]},"answer":"wouldn't","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-would-have"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l01","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-reunion","setting":"Dos excompañeros de colegio se encuentran veinte años después.","speakers":[{"name":"Paul","voice":"a"},{"name":"Clara","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Twenty years! Do you ever look back on our school days?"},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"All the time. If I had listened to Mrs. Gray, I would have studied science. I loved it, but I was too lazy."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"You weren't lazy. You just had a lot going on at home."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Maybe. And you? You were always the best at math."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"I dropped out of university in my second year. If I hadn't, I would have become an engineer."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Sometimes. If only I had asked for help when I was struggling. But if I hadn't left, I wouldn't have started my business. So I'm not sure."}]},"question":"¿Qué habría estudiado Clara si le hubiera hecho caso a su profesora?","options":["Ciencias","Matemática","Ingeniería","Administración"]},"answer":"Ciencias","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Clara dice: «If I had listened to Mrs. Gray, I would have studied science».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l01","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u9-reunion","setting":"Dos excompañeros de colegio se encuentran veinte años después.","speakers":[{"name":"Paul","voice":"a"},{"name":"Clara","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Twenty years! Do you ever look back on our school days?"},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"All the time. If I had listened to Mrs. Gray, I would have studied science. I loved it, but I was too lazy."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"You weren't lazy. You just had a lot going on at home."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Maybe. And you? You were always the best at math."},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"I dropped out of university in my second year. If I hadn't, I would have become an engineer."},{"speaker":"Clara","text":"Do you regret it?"},{"speaker":"Paul","text":"Sometimes. If only I had asked for help when I was struggling. But if I hadn't left, I wouldn't have started my business. So I'm not sure."}]},"question":"¿Por qué Paul no está seguro de arrepentirse?","options":["Porque si no hubiera dejado la facultad, no habría empezado su negocio","Porque no le gustaba la ingeniería","Porque nunca tuvo dificultades","Porque Clara lo convenció"]},"answer":"Porque si no hubiera dejado la facultad, no habría empezado su negocio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paul dice: «But if I hadn’t left, I wouldn’t have started my business. So I’m not sure».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l01","position":6,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"If I had studied, I would have passed the exam.","options":["If I had studied, I would have passed the exam.","If I study, I will pass the exam.","If I had studied, I would pass the exam.","If I had slept, I would have passed the exam."]},"answer":"If I had studied, I would have passed the exam.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-would-have"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l01","position":7,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordena las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["If","we","had","left","earlier","we","would","have","caught","the","train"],"translation":"Si hubiéramos salido antes, habríamos alcanzado el tren."},"answer":"If we had left earlier we would have caught the train.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-would-have"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l01","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responde en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why did you fail the test? (si hubieras estudiado, habrías aprobado)","translation":"¿Por qué desaprobaste la prueba?"},"answer":"If I had studied, I would have passed.","accepted_answers":["If I'd studied, I would have passed.","If I had studied, I'd have passed.","If I had studied more, I would have passed."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-would-have"]},{"id":"b2-u09-l01-e09","lesson_id":"b2-u09-l0