","options":["assumption","argument","opinion","answer"]},"answer":"assumption","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-assumption"]},{"id":"b2-u10-rev2-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u10-rev2","position":6,"type":"order_words","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Ordena las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["That","is","a","valid","point"],"translation":"Es un argumento válido."},"answer":"That is a valid point.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":25,"words":["en-valid"]},{"id":"b2-u10-rev2-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u10-rev2","position":8,"type":"translate_write","skill":"translation","prompt_es":"Traduce al inglés","payload":{"type":"translate_write","source":"punto de vista"},"answer":"point of view","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-point-of-view"]},{"id":"b2-u10-rev2-e10","lesson_id":"b2-u10-rev2","position":10,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"nevertheless","options":["nevertheless","what matters is","outweigh","assumption"]},"answer":"nevertheless","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-nevertheless"]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e02","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":2,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"grammar","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The benefits ___ the costs.","translation":"Los beneficios superan a los costos.","options":["outweigh","outweighs","outweighed","sum up"]},"answer":"outweigh","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"The benefits (plural) outweigh.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-outweigh"]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e03","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":3,"type":"fill_blank","skill":"vocabulary","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"To sum ___, I think the plan is a good idea.","translation":"En resumen, creo que el plan es una buena idea.","options":["up","out","on","off"]},"answer":"up","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-to-sum-up"]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e04","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":4,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo de opinión sobre la universidad gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"¿Con qué idea cierra la autora?","options":["Que la universidad gratuita es una inversión en todos, no un regalo","Que la universidad debería ser más barata","Que los estudiantes deben pagar","Que el gobierno gasta mal"]},"answer":"Que la universidad gratuita es una inversión en todos, no un regalo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo termina: «To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e05","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":5,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo de opinión sobre la universidad gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"¿Qué enfatiza la oración «It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance»?","options":["Que lo realmente caro es no educar a la gente","Que la educación es muy cara","Que la ignorancia no tiene costo","Que el gobierno debería gastar menos"]},"answer":"Que lo realmente caro es no educar a la gente","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Con It is… that…, la autora pone el foco en «the cost of ignorance»: lo preocupante no es pagar la educación sino la falta de ella.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-four-days","setting":"Unos colegas discuten la propuesta de trabajar cuatro días por semana.","speakers":[{"name":"Olivia","voice":"a"},{"name":"Ken","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"So, the four-day week. What worries me is the customers. Who answers the phone on Fridays?"},{"speaker":"Ken","text":"We'd take turns. The reason why other companies have done it is that people work better when they're rested."},{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"That may be true for some jobs. But we need to take into account that our clients expect us every day."},{"speaker":"Ken","text":"That's a valid point. So let's try it for three months and measure the results."},{"speaker":"Olivia","text":"OK, I find that convincing. All things considered, a trial is a good compromise."}]},"question":"¿Cómo termina la discusión?","options":["Olivia se convence: probar tres meses es un buen término medio","No se ponen de acuerdo","Ken retira la propuesta","Deciden preguntarle al jefe"]},"answer":"Olivia se convence: probar tres meses es un buen término medio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Olivia dice: «OK, I find that convincing. All things considered, a trial is a good compromise».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":7,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"All things considered, it was a good year.","options":["All things considered, it was a good year.","All things considered, it was a bad year.","All things considered, it will be a good year.","All in all, it was a good year."]},"answer":"All things considered, it was a good year.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"words":["en-all-things-considered"]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":8,"type":"short_answer","skill":"sentence_building","prompt_es":"Responde en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"So, should we buy the house? (en resumen, crees que sí)","translation":"Entonces, ¿compramos la casa?"},"answer":"To sum up, I think we should.","accepted_answers":["To sum up, I think we should buy it.","To sum up, yes.","To sum up, I think we should buy the house."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"words":["en-to-sum-up"]},{"id":"b2-u10-l05-e09","lesson_id":"b2-u10-l05","position":9,"type":"trans