nager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"¿Qué solución propone la gerente?","options":["Ninguna parte cede del todo: una sola lista de cambios esenciales y el equipo de Leo decide qué es posible","Cancelar el lanzamiento","Hacer todos los cambios de ventas","Que Leo decida solo"]},"answer":"Ninguna parte cede del todo: una sola lista de cambios esenciales y el equipo de Leo decide qué es posible","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"La gerente dice: «Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u12-l04-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l04","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Una reunión tensa de un equipo antes de presentar un proyecto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"¿Por qué Leo defiende a su equipo?","options":["Porque trabajaron todos los fines de semana del mes","Porq