h other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"¿Qué dos ventajas destaca el aviso sobre el servicio?","options":["Que es gratuito y confidencial","Que es rápido y barato","Que es obligatorio y gratuito","Que funciona los fines de semana"]},"answer":"Que es gratuito y confidencial","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El aviso dice: «Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u12-l05-e06","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l05","position":6,"type":"context_choice","skill":"reading","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u12-neighbors","document":"notice","setting":"Un aviso de un servicio de mediación entre vecinos.","title":"Problems with your neighbors?","lines":["Community Mediation Service","Has a conflict with a neighbor gone on for too long? Noise, parking, trees, pets… We can help you resolve it.","Our mediators do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground.","Not only is the service free, but it is also confidential. Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission.","Should you need more information, please visit the community center from Monday to Friday."]},"question":"¿Qué promete el servicio sobre tu información?","options":["Que nunca la va a compartir con la otra persona sin tu permiso","Que la publica en el centro comunitario","Que la comparte con la policía","Que la borra después de una semana"]},"answer":"Que nunca la va a compartir con la otra persona sin tu permiso","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El aviso dice: «Under no circumstances will we share your information with the other person without your permission».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u12-l05-e07","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l05","position":7,"type":"context_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Una reunión tensa de un equipo antes de presentar un proyecto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"¿Qué quiere decir la gerente con «Only then can we finish on time»?","options":["Que sólo con ese acuerdo van a poder terminar a tiempo","Que van a terminar tarde igual","Que el cliente decide la fecha","Que hay que empezar de nuevo"]},"answer":"Que sólo con ese acuerdo van a poder terminar a tiempo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Only then + auxiliar + sujeto: sólo si hacen lo que propuso podrán terminar a tiempo.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"words":[]},{"id":"b2-u12-l05-e08","lesson_id":"b2-u12-l05","position":8,"type":"listen_choice","skill":"listening","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":