 next one. It is said that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"So nothing has really changed?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Customs change, of course. Fewer people get married in church, for example, and family dinners are less common. But the values behind them haven't disappeared."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Young people still care about their families. They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"¿Para qué menciona la socióloga a los antiguos griegos?","options":["Para mostrar que la queja sobre los jóvenes es muy antigua","Para hablar de la historia de Grecia","Para decir que los griegos eran mejores","Para explicar una costumbre griega"]},"answer":"Para mostrar que la queja sobre los jóvenes es muy antigua","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dice: «It is said that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.xfe4w9hc8rjs4m","content_hash":"v1:16eda0699c4f35a9fd4cc7895435eced0da04dde2aa2064644c37093ba491143","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-podcast","setting":"Un pódcast entrevista a una socióloga sobre las generaciones.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Dr. Reyes","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"People often complain that young people have no respect for old customs. Is that true?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Every generation has said that about the next one. It is said that even the ancient Greeks complained about their teenagers."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"So nothing has really changed?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Customs change, of course. Fewer people get married in church, for example, and family dinners are less common. But the values behind them haven't disappeared."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"What do you mean?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Young people still care about their families. They just show it in different ways: a video call instead of a Sunday lunch."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And is the gap between generations getting bigger?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Reyes","text":"Honestly, I don't think so. Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things."}]},"question":"¿Qué opina la socióloga de la idea de que la distancia entre generaciones es cada vez mayor?","options":["Que mucha gente lo cree, pero su investigación no lo confirma","Que es cierta","Que es nueva","Que nadie la cree"]},"answer":"Que mucha gente lo cree, pero su investigación no lo confirma","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dice: «Many people believe that, but my research shows that parents and children agree about most things».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.fv0sbrtdmjk0zf","content_hash":"v1:4b6a2e487c7a873f9794767b818ed8b50cd9129f06d89f9db80174e4bd39083a","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u3-market","document":"notice","setting":"Un aviso de la municipalidad sobre el mercado viejo.","title":"Our market is changing","lines":["The old market is being renovated and will be closed until the end of May.","The roof has already been repaired, and new lights are being installed this month.","The market has been used by local families for more than a hundred years. It is believed to be the oldest building in th