d mood, it might be stress, or a lack of sleep."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And what about self-confidence?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Moss","text":"People with low self-confidence tend to think that others are judging them. Usually, others are too busy thinking about themselves!"}]},"question":"Según el psicólogo, ¿la empatía es lo mismo que estar de acuerdo?","options":["No: es entender cómo se siente otro, aunque no estés de acuerdo","Sí, es lo mismo","Sí, pero sólo con amigos","No: es dar consejos"]},"answer":"No: es entender cómo se siente otro, aunque no estés de acuerdo","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Dice: «It is the ability to understand how another person feels… It’s not the same as agreeing with them».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.p2xmj7a529i7k1","content_hash":"v1:8e75947ba03e8297526c4e5abfff15b512c596d800d917ea801ca391de428732","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u6-podcast","setting":"Un pódcast sobre psicología entrevista a un psicólogo.","speakers":[{"name":"Host","voice":"a"},{"name":"Dr. Moss","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Host","text":"Today we are talking about empathy. What exactly is it?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Moss","text":"It is the ability to understand how another person feels, to put yourself in their shoes. It's not the same as agreeing with them."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"Can empathy be learned?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Moss","text":"Yes. The first step is to listen without judging. Most of us listen only to answer."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"Some listeners say their mood changes very quickly. Is that normal?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Moss","text":"Everybody has good and bad days. But if you are often in a bad mood, it might be stress, or a lack of sleep."},{"speaker":"Host","text":"And what about self-confidence?"},{"speaker":"Dr. Moss