 drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"How are farmers dealing with it?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"With great difficulty. Even though they have reduced their water use, many have lost half of their crops. And there is now a water shortage in three towns."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Is this connected to global warming?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Scientists say yes. Ironically, two years ago this same region suffered terrible floods. Extreme weather, in both directions, is a direct consequence of a warmer planet."}]},"question":"¿Por qué los ríos siguen bajos?","options":["Porque las tormentas de la semana pasada no alcanzaron después de ocho meses sin lluvia","Porque los agricultores usan demasiada agua","Porque hubo inundaciones","Porque cerraron una represa"]},"answer":"Porque las tormentas de la semana pasada no alcanzaron después de ocho meses sin lluvia","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paula dice: «This is the worst drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.v2ief0lo3hj01r","content_hash":"v1:4160d2d558a6fa5cb5d25b7c40620d445712564dc844ad56a342e478b8ca13c7","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u7-drought","setting":"Un informe de radio sobre la sequía en una región agrícola.","speakers":[{"name":"Presenter","voice":"a"},{"name":"Paula","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"We go now to Paula, who is in the south, where there hasn't been any real rain for eight months."},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Thanks. This is the worst drought in fifty years. Despite the storms last week, the rivers are still very low."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"How are farmers dealing with it?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"With great difficulty. Even though they have reduced their water use, many have lost half of their crops. And there is now a water shortage in three towns."},{"speaker":"Presenter","text":"Is this connected to global warming?"},{"speaker":"Paula","text":"Scientists say yes. Ironically, two years ago this same region suffered terrible floods. Extreme weather, in both directions, is a direct consequence of a warmer planet."}]},"question":"¿Qué tiene de irónico la situación, según Paula?","options":["Que hace dos años la misma región sufrió inundaciones terribles","Que nunca había llovido tanto","Que los agricultores ganaron más","Que los científicos no saben la causa"]},"answer":"Que hace dos años la misma región sufrió inundaciones terribles","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Paula dice: «Ironically, two years ago this same region suffered terrible floods».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.mjmh131toer7vg","content_hash":"v1:50d683d4b34205a83ae81511397fc6578e362512831fa7c92813a147cb18b4cf","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u7-report","document":"notice","setting":"Un resumen de un informe de una organización ambiental.","title":"Our planet: 2026 report","lines":["Key findings of our annual report:","More than one million species are endangered, mainly because of the loss of forests and the pollution of oceans.","Climate change is a growing threat not only to nature, but to people. Floods and droughts hit the poorest countries hardest, even though they produce the lowest emissions.","Poverty and the environment are connected: when people are poor, they often have no choice but to cut down forests to survive.","Despite these problems, there is good news. Several species have been saved in the last ten years, which shows that action works."]},"question":"¿A quiénes afectan más las sequías y las inundaciones, según el informe?","options":["A los países más pobres, aunque son los que menos contaminan","A los países más ricos","A las grandes empresas","A todos por igual"]},"answer":"A los países más pobres, aunque son los que menos contaminan","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El informe dice: «Floods and droughts hit the poorest countries hardest, even though they produce the lowest emissions».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.gd6hhdor1njoxc","content_hash":"v1:79f2f6d0ea85663eb0a3866940b04ed82156ed0b74e6814fba6b2cc9c186ef02","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"The flood destroyed many homes.","options":["The flood destroyed many homes.","The flood destroyed many roads.","The storm destroyed many homes.","The floods destroyed a few homes."]},"answer":"The flood destroyed many homes.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.y5be3ckuv6wvl6","content_hash":"v1:2bace6f5430c42e4e3c34d181efc02b2b23171ea8e2d7398dfc35aa6da37413d","prompt_es":"Responde en inglés","payload":{"type":"short_answer","question":"Why is there no water in the town? (por la sequía)","translation":"¿Por qué no hay agua en el pueblo?"},"answer":"Because of the drought.","accepted_answers":["Because there is a drought.","It's because of the drought.","Because of the drought, there is no water."],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"normalized_text","mode_version":1,"normalizer":"polygo.answers.v1","typo_tolerance":true},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.9i8lh3blmamc68","content_hash":"v1:0859dc024ce43e146bb4cd069c71654c80d