students","setting":"Dos estudiantes discuten si una persona puede ayudar al planeta.","speakers":[{"name":"Noah","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mia","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I've stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"That's great, but honestly, it won't change anything. Even if everyone in this city stopped flying, it would be a tiny difference."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I don't agree. Big changes always start with small groups of people."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"Maybe. But we need to tackle the real causes: coal, oil, and the way we produce food."},{"speaker":"Noah","text":"Sure, but those things change when people demand something different."},{"speaker":"Mia","text":"OK, that's a fair point. So we both want a sustainable future. We just disagree about how to get there."}]},"question":"¿En qué terminan de acuerdo Noah y Mia?","options":["Los dos quieren un futuro sostenible, pero no coinciden en cómo llegar","Los dos van a dejar de volar","No coinciden en nada","Mia acepta que una persona puede cambiar todo"]},"answer":"Los dos quieren un futuro sostenible, pero no coinciden en cómo llegar","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Mia dice: «So we both want a sustainable future. We just disagree about how to get there».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.cf5fofv5ynrims","content_hash":"v1:9056d543309dc7e678ed5386d8f5f93179d656c1fd1f2e065fea36b5e1cf9c4b","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u7-students","setting":"Dos estudiantes discuten si una persona puede ayudar al planeta.","speakers":[{"name":"Noah","voice":"a"},{"name":"Mia","voice":"b"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Noah","text":"I've stopped flying. In spite of the price, I take the train to visit my family."},{"spe