ra con su significado","payload":{"type":"match_pairs","pairs":[{"left":"debate","right":"debate"},{"left":"moreover","right":"además (formal)"},{"left":"furthermore","right":"asimismo / es más"},{"left":"as a result","right":"como resultado / por eso"}]},"answer":"","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":30,"grading_spec":{"mode":"pair_set","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.m65wxo4gn725ss","content_hash":"v1:2470e60fc2ff48dcd2d1ef87d4866347984b8c0bc1d4588c439363209b00ce32","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"The plan is cheap. ___, it is easy to start.","translation":"El plan es barato. Además, es fácil de empezar.","options":["Moreover","However","Although","Unless"]},"answer":"Moreover","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Moreover suma una razón a favor; however marca un contraste.","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.8078rklp5dugsv","content_hash":"v1:c09691980652d575d4fea9270a83a7b8b281e861666c018faef47809fe27e912","prompt_es":"Completa la frase","payload":{"type":"fill_blank","sentence":"It rained all week. As a ___, the match was canceled.","translation":"Llovió toda la semana. Como resultado, se canceló el partido.","options":["result","reason","end","point"]},"answer":"result","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.894eqviy0f4nug","content_hash":"v1:a4c741307d40123f636472145a089b913f64cacff1a10d39f1cab0a8fdeecfa0","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-school-debate","setting":"Un debate en un colegio: ¿hay que prohibir los teléfonos en clase?","speakers":[{"name":"Moderator","voice":"a"},{"name":"Lucas","voice":"b"},{"name":"Hannah","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Today's debate: should phones be banned in schools? Lucas, you're first."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"Yes, they should. Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school. As a result, many students feel anxious all day."},{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Hannah, your answer?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Admittedly, phones can be a distraction. Nevertheless, banning them is not the answer. On the contrary, schools should teach students how to use them responsibly."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"But that's an assumption. Where is the evidence that teaching works better?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Fair question. What I'm saying is that a ban doesn't teach anything. In other words, students will just use their phones more at home."}]},"question":"¿Qué razones da Lucas para prohibir los teléfonos?","options":["Distraen y facilitan el acoso, que sigue después del colegio","Son caros","Se rompen fácilmente","Los profesores no saben usarlos"]},"answer":"Distraen y facilitan el acoso, que sigue después del colegio","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Lucas dice: «Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.3gtsax6h604o73","content_hash":"v1:403b4e6dba6daff080f7c67f166765000e891093866ae168816983163a2b44d3","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-school-debate","setting":"Un debate en un colegio: ¿hay que prohibir los teléfonos en clase?","speakers":[{"name":"Moderator","voice":"a"},{"name":"Lucas","voice":"b"},{"name":"Hannah","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Today's debate: should phones be banned in schools? Lucas, you're first."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"Yes, they should. Phones distract students. Moreover, they make bullying easier, because it continues after school. As a result, many students feel anxious all day."},{"speaker":"Moderator","text":"Hannah, your answer?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Admittedly, phones can be a distraction. Nevertheless, banning them is not the answer. On the contrary, schools should teach students how to use them responsibly."},{"speaker":"Lucas","text":"But that's an assumption. Where is the evidence that teaching works better?"},{"speaker":"Hannah","text":"Fair question. What I'm saying is that a ban doesn't teach anything. In other words, students will just use their phones more at home."}]},"question":"¿Qué consecuencia menciona Lucas?","options":["Muchos estudiantes se sienten ansiosos todo el día","Los estudiantes sacan malas notas","Los padres se quejan","El colegio gasta más"]},"answer":"Muchos estudiantes se sienten ansiosos todo el día","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Lucas dice: «As a result, many students feel anxious all day».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.e7ene965i18ksy","content_hash":"v1:44f5f6c9ba9baef19a1d48b8b73da96953594f577e11186ccc2c1b032ae1b034","prompt_es":"Lee y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"reading","id":"en.stim.b2-u10-free-uni","document":"post","setting":"Un artículo de opinión sobre la universidad gratuita.","title":"Education is an investment, not a cost","lines":["Should university be free? I believe it should.","First, education benefits everyone, not only the student. Educated citizens earn more, pay more taxes and are healthier. Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones.","Admittedly, free universities cost the government a lot of money, and some people argue that students should pay for their own future. Nevertheless, the long-term benefits outweigh the costs.","It is not the cost of education that should worry us, but the cost of ignorance.","To sum up, free university is not a gift. It is an investment in all of us."]},"question":"¿Qué segundo argumento suma la autora con furthermore?","options":["Que la educación gratuita da a los estudiantes pobres las mismas oportunidades","Que los graduados pagan menos impuestos","Que las universidades son baratas","Que los ricos no deberían estudiar"]},"answer":"Que la educación gratuita da a los estudiantes pobres las mismas oportunidades","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"El artículo dice: «Furthermore, free education gives poor students the same chances as rich ones».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.of0vdx7zcu63x6","content_hash":"v1:c03aaed44529203f83adab4ca80b60c4710d025ea5b49162cc59a5e6edf3f660","prompt_es":"Escucha y elige lo que oyes","payload":{"type":"listen_choice","audioText":"We had a debate about social media.","options":["We had a debate about social media.","We had a debate about the news.","We have a debate about social media.","They had a debate about social media."]},"answer":"We had a debate about social media.","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":null,"difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":15,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.3epwoj2vs3o2m0","content_hash":"v1:d8528ca23dd6fabf78782b532cbdd4d3a7f5b2eb826af4a43ce8fc1f90cbbf7e","prompt_es":"Ordena las palabras","payload":{"type":"order_words","tokens":["Furthermore","free","education","gives","everyone","the","same","chances"],"translation":"Asimismo, la educación gratuita da a todos las mismas oportunidades."},"answer":"Furthermore free education gives everyone the same chances.","accepted_answers":[],"explanat