 do not take sides. Their job is to help both people listen to each other and find common ground».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":60,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"generator":null,"generator_version":null},{"item_id":"en.ex.l6wdjggo2brcdw","content_hash":"v1:b78b1ff0e2409f3a1b8b0e9f10fec25735e83ff1aa98c65c17cc72d67a04b753","prompt_es":"Escucha y responde","payload":{"type":"context_choice","stimulus":{"kind":"listening","id":"en.stim.b2-u12-team-conflict","setting":"Una reunión tensa de un equipo antes de presentar un proyecto.","speakers":[{"name":"Manager","voice":"a"},{"name":"Leo","voice":"b"},{"name":"Ines","voice":"a"}],"rate":1,"lines":[{"speaker":"Manager","text":"I know there has been a conflict between design and sales. Let’s sort it out today."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch. We can't keep doing that."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"We're only asking because a big client is at stake. If we lose them, everyone loses."},{"speaker":"Leo","text":"I understand, but I have to stand up for my team. They've worked every weekend this month."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"OK. Neither side has to back down completely. Ines, send one list of changes, the essential ones only. Leo, your team decides what is possible."},{"speaker":"Ines","text":"That sounds fair."},{"speaker":"Manager","text":"Good. Only then can we finish on time."}]},"question":"¿Cuál es el conflicto entre diseño y ventas?","options":["Ventas quiere cambiar el diseño dos días antes del lanzamiento","Diseño no quiere trabajar los fines de semana","Ventas perdió un cliente","Nadie quiere hacer el proyecto"]},"answer":"Ventas quiere cambiar el diseño dos días antes del lanzamiento","accepted_answers":[],"explanation_es":"Leo dice: «The sales team wants to change the design again, two days before the launch».","difficulty":1,"recommended_seconds":75,"grading_spec":{"mode":"exact_option","mode_version":1},"g